flowchart LR
  Upload[Document upload] --> Store[Storage abstraction]
  Store --> Parse[Parse and chunk]
  Parse --> Embed[Embedding provider]
  Embed --> Vector[(pgvector)]
  Query[Conversation query] --> Retrieve[Scoped retrieval]
  Vector --> Retrieve
  Retrieve --> Prompt[Grounded prompt]
  Prompt --> Model[OpenAI-compatible provider]
  Model --> Answer[Answer and usage record]
